msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I guess it does look like a turtle. If this is the one\r\n"
"mentioned in the song..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Then this is <Color:7>the sacred turtle's spot<Color:Default>! The treasure's got to\r\n"
"be right under this rock!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Lend me a hand, Kiryu-san! It's digging time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Here goes nothing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Oh! I see something! Keep digging!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Can't back down now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "I think it's some sort of pot... Please, keep digging!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "You're mine, treasure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "What the!?"
msgstr "Ma che!?"

msgctxt "352"
msgid "There it is, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "An awamori pot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"I see... <Color:7>A golden foam<Color:Default> must have meant awamori foam! After\r\n"
"all, top-notch awamori produces a beautiful head of foam\r\n"
"when you distill it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"So this big family heirloom you were after is just a bottle\r\n"
"of liquor? I don't think this'll help you pay off that debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Don't you see, Kiryu-san!? This isn't any old bottle of\r\n"
"liquor! It's an <Italic>extremely</Italic> old bottle of liquor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"This awamori was distilled in the 9th year of the Meiji\r\n"
"Era... which makes it over 130 years old!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"130 years, huh? I'm not sure it's the miracle you seem to\r\n"
"think it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"But it is, it is! Right now the oldest intact awamori in the\r\n"
"whole world is just 140. We're nipping at their heels!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You can't put a price tag on a vintage like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"So your ancestors crafted this masterpiece, then buried it\r\n"
"to keep it safe. No wonder your family treated it like some\r\n"
"kind of sacred treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"And because all its years have been spent underground, it's\r\n"
"extremely well-preserved! I don't see any cracks, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Still... I'm not sure it's worth the 20 million I owe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Hey, Matsushima! You trying to skip town or somethin'!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Eep! Don't tell me you followed me here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "What's that you got there, huh? An awamori pot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Well, the truth is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You shittin' me!? 130 years old!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Assuming the date etched on the pot is correct... yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"How 'bout that. My boss is always goin' on about wanting to\r\n"
"get his hands on a hundred-year-old vintage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Is that why you're after my distillery?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Heh, you could say that. But hey, I got a deal for you. Hand\r\n"
"over the awamori, and we're all square on your debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Huh? You'd walk away from 20 million yen just like that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"The boss was gonna use that cash to buy a pot of vintage,\r\n"
"anyway. Doin' it this way cuts out the middleman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"And besides, you can't exactly buy 130 year old awamori on\r\n"
"the market, no matter how much cash you got. So the way I\r\n"
"look at it, this is a pretty sweet deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Huh. Your boss must really love this stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "You bet. That's the only reason I know all this shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"Y'know, Matsushima-san, I know it might not mean much comin'\r\n"
"from me, but you really do make the best awamori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "You really think so...?"
msgstr "Lo pensi davvero?"

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah. From now on, I want you to stop borrowing from\r\n"
"shady fellas like me. Get yourself a solid business plan and\r\n"
"leave all this debt nonsense behind, y'hear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "I will!"
msgstr "Lo farò!"

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"In the meantime, get that baby over to our office. We'll\r\n"
"settle your debt right then and there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "I can't believe it... I saved my distillery!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "And it's all thanks to you, Kiryu-san. Thank you so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"You should be thanking the ancestors who buried that pot of\r\n"
"awamori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"Here, take this. It's a special little something I found collecting dust in "
"our family stores. You'll make way better use of it than I ever would!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "I didn't really do that much, but okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Shisa Belt<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Well, I've gotta go deliver this. Hope I see you around\r\n"
"sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

